<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs020" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Four people in one row under a working title, each an identical cell with a circular portrait, a name, a role and one line.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="0Yr5sy0Qk9"><h2>The team behind the plan</h2><grid image-shape="circle" image-aspect="square" spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="15" id="SVxNDE7Dfr"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:2048,&quot;has_transparency&quot;:false}" alt="Documentary portrait of a woman in her forties in a plain work shirt standing in a warehouse aisle, natural light, calm expression, neutral background" image-style="plain-photo" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="j68gk1pi47z0bnw" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/8099122cc98e03d18da59308a73999fb/YL0KiGCbyMw4beA9Rj8RF.jpg"><h4>Petra Toth</h4><p font-size="sm">Head of Operations</p><p>Owns routes, stock and the second shift.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="GvZHo73WsD"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:2048,&quot;has_transparency&quot;:false}" alt="Documentary portrait of a man in his thirties in a dark sweater at a plain office desk, natural window light, neutral background, calm expression" image-style="plain-photo" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="roi2djd59ofafoo" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/5ab6aee896c11babd87ef7a1319a0be4/b4hKGPqWt9SukeovTv9_k.jpg"><h4>Marek Dabrowski</h4><p font-size="sm">Regional Sales Lead</p><p>Owns the standing-schedule accounts.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="zjDdacuFS0"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:2048,&quot;has_transparency&quot;:false}" alt="Documentary portrait of a woman in her fifties in a plain blazer in a bright meeting room, natural light, neutral background, calm expression" image-style="plain-photo" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="bfyd0ow64rm2gem" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/29513af5200e5a6c32f43a97efaab529/d5_GsfdNM8_9CFoURMJ57.jpg"><h4>Eva Wisniewski</h4><p font-size="sm">Finance Director</p><p>Owns the plan, the close and the review.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="NP3dLfnBIx"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:2048,&quot;has_transparency&quot;:false}" alt="Documentary portrait of a man in his forties in a plain shirt beside a product shelf, natural light, neutral background, calm expression" image-style="plain-photo" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="hfqipytgqdac24i" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/cf412c978f045121fa0b7c895bed105b/ITGxc-JpLL19d7x8pR_3K.jpg"><h4>Tomasz Nowak</h4><p font-size="sm">Product Marketing</p><p>Owns the relaunch of the two new lines.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>